research_rationale:
EO 13326 established the President's Commission on Implementation of United States Space Exploration Policy and contains no provision other than those of a commission order (membership, mission, administration, reports, termination). Its termination clause reads "(b) The Commission shall terminate within 60 days after submitting its final report." That clause is triggered by the date of a report and is not an end under owner ruling 2026-10-21-report-deadline; the report date is not held in any source in the repository, so it is disclosed here and not recorded as an end. Section 3 of EO 13385 of September 29, 2005 (70 FR 57989, published October 4, 2005)  revokes the order by number with the words "(b) Executive Order 13326, establishing the President ’s Commission on 
Implementation of United States Space Exploration Policy." and the first dated end held is 2005-09-30.  Later orders that name the parent order this one modifies: EO 13381 (2005-06-27), EO 13470 (2008-07-30) and EO 13526 (2009-12-29) act on EO 12958, a different order. A by-number search of the held order texts for EO 13326 returns only EO 13385 (and its copies), so none of those three names this order or ends, shortens or extends its commands; the end recorded here rests on EO 13385 alone.
Member checks: {"earlier_end_check":"Own text: the order's termination clause (\"(b) The Commission shall terminate within 60 days after submitting its \nfinal report.\") depends on the date of a final report that no held source dates; under the report-deadline ruling it is disclosed and not treated as an end. No fixed calendar sunset appears in the order. Searched held texts by the order's number: only the order's own copies and the revoking order cite it. No earlier revocation or supersession is held.","independent_command_check":"All commands in the order establish, staff, direct or report from the commission; none is an independent continuing command outside it. The revocation is express and unqualified, so no clause is carved out.","savings_check":"No savings language appears in the revoking order for EO 13326.","scope_check":"The inventory is the 20 scopes the packet derives from the Federal Register text of EO 13326; every scope belongs to the single commission order, and Section 3 of EO 13385 of September 29, 2005 (70 FR 57989, published October 4, 2005) revokes the order as a whole without exception."}
